Little Auk - Trearddur Bay, Anglesey 26/02/26. Terrific find by John Oates on what was a pretty miserable day weather wise. Pretty rare on west coast, now on WBRC list. Not the easiest conditions for photography, but managed a few images that I was happy with. 
